          text-decoration: underline dotted;
        }

        /* Source code view: a call site whose count the capture did not have.
           A dashed underline rather than the 'not taken' background:  the site
           is not known to have been missed, only not measured */
        a.callSiteUnknown
        {
          color: #COLOR_15;
          text-decoration: underline dashed;
        }

        /* Source code view: where a call site goes and how often - one
           'count: name' line per destination, drawn on hover from the
